---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base noindex title="Privacy | TellRep">
  <article class="wrap legal">
    <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
    <p class="note mono">Draft. To be reviewed before go live (revFADP, and GDPR for EU visitors).</p>
    <h2>Controller</h2>
    <p>TellRep, [address follows on incorporation], <a href="mailto:info@tellrep.ch">info@tellrep.ch</a></p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you request a CH-REP analysis we process the data you enter: name, company, email, country, device classes, number of device families and UDI-DIs, and your message. We use it only to answer your request and prepare a quote.</p>
    <h2>Form processing</h2>
    <p>Form submissions are transmitted to [form service, e.g. Web3Forms] and forwarded to us by email. [Add the processor's location and safeguards.]</p>
    <h2>Hosting and fonts</h2>
    <p>This website is hosted by [hosting provider]. Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts. [Consider self hosting the fonts before go live.] We do not use analytics or advertising cookies.</p>
    <h2>Retention and your rights</h2>
    <p>We delete enquiries that do not lead to a mandate after 24 months. You can request access, correction or deletion of your data at any time by email.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
<style>
  .legal { max-width: 720px; padding-block: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px); display: grid; gap: 14px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 52px); letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  h2 { font-size: 20px; margin-top: 12px; }
  p { color: var(--slate); }
  .note { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--red); }
</style>
